  "scope": [
    "The exporter traverses every Cell constructor but generic producer success, checker acceptance for all source Cells, and exact source-Cell syntax recovery are not proved. Only successful checked outputs have the stated unconditional soundness guarantee.",
    "Default fuel is source tree node count plus one. No polynomial generation, minimality, optimal sharing, or total proof-size bound is established.",
    "Typed payload data are checked; the plan-shape decoder has a left-inverse theorem. A text/binary decoder and whole-certificate serialization round-trip theorem remain open.",
    "Condition support is conservative declared support, preserved exactly. No condition extraction from arbitrary proof terms, semantic minimality, or optimal repair algorithm.",
    "The ordinary model in this step assumes all local model conditions; finite-support repair is proved via the reconstructed geometric value. No independent ordinary finite-support repair generator or total-cost benchmark is supplied.",
    "The MAC attack and retained source/target states and trace are unchanged; existing 1/256 security bound and semantics are reused, without new native execution/time claims.",
    "Shared and unshared are two representations of the SAME generated diagram. They are not geometric versus ordinary independent proof-generation methods. Both semantic interpretations may use the same shared certificate.",
    "Only stages 0..4 were measured. The observed 48+41*stage source count is a checked finite-sample observation, not an all-stages theorem.",
    "No general finite mixed higher basis, full copy/discard extension, exclusive higher-dimensional size/time advantage, or publication novelty is claimed."
  ],
